      "writtenOn": "2021-06-28T15:39:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the time being, we\u0027ll use a software KM inside the VM with keyblobs encrypted with a VM-derived secret that can be safely stored outside of the VM. This change adapts a copy of the reference implementation to use encrypted keyblob rather than the integrity assured keyblobs that are usually used. Hooking it up to that VM\u0027s secret will be a future step (see the TODOs).",
      "revId": "44b9f96fd3e92a8f22720cd4fa6a547fc0a3a79b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
